    "Name": "Stalker STK-ST",
    "Details": "A Risc Testing Bed for the Streak MML's and Cloaking Technology. Equipped with the Latest Breakthroughs in a lot of Fields, this Stalker has made its way onto the Battlefield by the Virtue of Battlefield testing. Apparently the Name was given to this Mech due to enemies Catching Stray shots in the Heat of Battle, when it was actually this Mech. Streak MML's are a Sight to Behold.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Combat Computer</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.21</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Left Upper, Right Upper</color>",
